## 🔧 WordPress Plugin API Usage

### 1. Hooks and Filters

```php
// Actions
add_action('init', 'rank_math_api_init');
add_action('wp_enqueue_scripts', 'rank_math_api_enqueue_scripts');
add_action('admin_enqueue_scripts', 'rank_math_api_admin_scripts');

// Filters
add_filter('the_content', 'rank_math_api_filter_content');
